  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edb90a87d0beb3f4c838fd08",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "最终的第五场比赛，胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n把最棒的结果献给了团队！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef0ad37c72e1afb94939f3fd1ec1fdedf108ba8a2620812a9cf0c01860bc996",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:407de9253a142aea2988fbbb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_ta1制霸了第五场比赛！\n总计分数也值得期待！\n结果将会如何呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5503eed970cc72fd40047422beb13b67435bc5d6e7f48f1997d5a424420b6303",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee9b40f3d855d218c57894cc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n她用精彩的奔跑，为比赛画上了完美的句号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46dfd8395d3739a18b6138f05c13d79d0041d84d5712d0278d3941bbfe465d83",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91d49e4fe3c714f7ca31c7df",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "短距離比赛的团队代表战\n胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n为队伍献上了精彩的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ce3f3b51d8b1ca8fcd897a99d5204fafab9c4efe6bf9b67027bd9e9d393305",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c642771c02bcdbfc986e2a61",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "英里比赛的团队代表战\n胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n将精彩的胜利献给了给队伍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6e7221b88d30add638bbbe088e18f239f53400f08fa7a7550814c4294b2ca8d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b539202a5b816fdf37e253f7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "中距離比赛的团队代表战\n胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n将胜利的纽带继续连结了下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83d1756fd9eae1162e1ae7ae643d9d5584f030dcf7a02565ba92577ac599b6e2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d399dc965e622b81a3aa584",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "长距离比赛的团队代表战\n胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n背负队伍的期望，完成了重任！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f2b111e396a64e998deaed21396032c67ecec167b8b5d7ab728766a50bddedc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c575ff01451b51b3ec491705",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "沙土比赛的团队代表战\n胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n回应了队伍的期待，最棒的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fd59676eedbf05d40f7095a25f8734c5989ecd69157fcf5f0f132a66e9d597f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49d20d5887e13d66e25c64e0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在晴空之下举行，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "eda02d95ed40b4a53e73512bbfbd11da489f19b54260ad091c3072d037678655",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d08fc7c92f16e4c5a98905e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在多云天气下举行，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3879dc050fefda45c99a8300590fe8727da871d313d050721992c67204e337b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec6037d57dd25cb9580be9b8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1\n击败众多劲敌\n成功夺得英里女王之名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1b229c1b495da482f8932fa798b6f83d86b36516778b17d76fa5f6a7f30d323",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8442d1c0a12afcfa6061916",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在令脚底泥泞的大雨中，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "73647efca18d1a81d6cdb62885806ad4813d0a79a8e503d05638f32293ba81c4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f515a46a8555f8462ea11f6c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "仍然寒冷的%course，等待着挑战者\n大雪中的%race\n%ground%distance\n究竟哪位赛马娘能够抵达胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1966fc1fd0492ad3a0e5ce6626444b6cdadf7df404735a5d09b47808dbbf29bc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fa2c6e94bbd9957e5cb7da6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "美丽的青空之下，%course\n的草地形成了绝佳的良马场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36114fe80af0f34518f19ae2af548b7cd08cbc889baa066c5abf423e617181d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:528938848d7ae1a4136fe004",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "灿烂的阳光之下，%course\n良状态的马场上飞舞着沙尘",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f5be29a69115297198874ed9b9532d9751cf62d7a7edb946686e46516354e61",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f6cdf9ba56d79b68838c44f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "美丽的云彩在天空流动\n青空万里之下，%course\n因为前几天的降雨\n马场状态是称不上绝好的稍重",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cec209c81147a5432ec12acdd85e0877e08273ccdbd548e4070e761bd0c775f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f32cedab68e9bfd51e9fb0c1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "比赛在晴天下举行，%course\n由于反复降水的天气\n现在马场状态为稍重",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f06a6dfefea871585f67059b1ae73da15214d45862647e20da8c7f4f4fd7a67",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a28a8677283d12111bd39bf3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "上方的天空布满灰色，%course\n天气并无过多变化，马场状态为良",
      "source_fingerprint": "105866c17fc822bf5d9ae479507ddef7173a80024f09cafadb10254b900f6b5d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fe75baf499a134257d9fad5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "乌云密布的天空\n%course\n如同倒映这天气一般，草地状态是稍重",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea996bb5e822c0e62b9fd378ae5253bee53a51afdf29b8550d83bf0e651d4b0d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9e847c607a28c4052762e0e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "时常有雨落下，%course\n天气反复无常，\n马场的状态为稍重",
      "source_fingerprint": "23baee74faad87c5ed7dda0fd946c6f0b47aed06bc5251186f206e374d2acc8e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad9102129c7060759974ecd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "很不凑巧雨水打湿了草皮，%course\n马场的状态是重",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8fbecf9f58dc5f54f2b164c968c752f29054035391b6834ab2d84e8e7c14e1c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9d7d14f98635b3ad544922d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "太棒了，%h_rank_l1！\n给众多刺客予以反击！　取得了压倒性的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86aa19ef0e0ddaabd65c68c87395444489aa45f6e7e8512587ebab29f039aa8f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:525f55076bece4251b66f130",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "天空降下雨点，%course\n沙土马场的状态为重\n接下来会是一场艰苦的比赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "2487939ee676f62a832f707830687d7b8bb0459e68b9e209d5e4c58058fd39cd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d5fabcceef43047e5b781a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "天气恶劣，%course\n不停的大雨也在恶化马场状态\n目前状态为不良",
      "source_fingerprint": "77f6f5c4963d1e9e53fbb0d0bb6dfe5f5c667b2e74d3df34c456356a48e1dc24",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf6dc418058c929e361d1fc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "下着大雨，%course\n雨水渗入沙土，变得湿滑\n马场状态为不良！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a69ddd8b91847e6436ae1c42d3aff807333f63880c09f0500150c0472bd151a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd928995dda18cc7dfa69fc5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "从昨天开始一直下着雪，%course\n除雪后的草地状态是稍重",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c2d0699a43b24f1f642c22adb8b5fd58a85524e78ad28892f94beb125d2e311",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0014c9af3cd1b21e7a2ef3c7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在不断降下的雪花中，赛马娘们将进行赛跑的\n%course，沙土跑道的状态是稍重",
      "source_fingerprint": "e80fa7b0275827c9620d358d8cb979e08f387b151ad19168e2d06958f2765c11",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0d5d3f866b1bb5b941a2b5c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "飞舞的雪花染白了跑道\n除雪工作正在进行，%course\n马场状态是重",
      "source_fingerprint": "de4238361e62ea804ef95ad412e4bbb34053499ad4183e4d2df00b35a387ff24",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399ce1c4d1a91b576635f4bd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "灰色的天空飘舞着名为雪花的白色天使\n%course，沙土跑道的状态是重",
      "source_fingerprint": "965cedcee7dfd9d1b478cc9694ddac07550010c206ce3eeec4e2144d6ad58d3e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e36958f7ae82d533ddc28a00",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "备受瞩目的%a_h_player\\n十分有取得胜利的可能",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf2fe0d12a40e3ca51101b97fca5f575d546c52458f20d7ac69d8c4f3c18a1ef",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe2af5eae29dfd6e2636f4c6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "备受瞩目的%a_h_player，于%p_waku_ban起跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac6e3dc026514f167a4e966f746f75c0048218dff1329476a3286c89aa01252",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e86827c48a10c9621cb1bf9d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\n称霸冠军杯\n名副其实地登上了沙土女王的宝座！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f0ea05134053e5500506c3c8454c498ccefeba02be47ac5506b64eef9c72acb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f2c2d29d2a0310e19caec56",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能够表演一场下克上吗！？\\n%a_h_player\\n本场比赛的潜力股！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc49126b7d1595ac952fb190f793cc6ec246fb19c56c17e0032bd1672d9932c1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6b73b237746df271a8b82b3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "兼具人气与实力\n%legend\n针锋相对的决斗引人注目",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aa4e6e7795f9935ae78ddd91190110eb8f6224d10941074dca9d93d1899c1ac",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6238941eedbcc308d37b01e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "今天的主角毫无疑问是这位马娘\n%legend",
      "source_fingerprint": "0919b60eb401fbecaaf6a3d0a4c8ad4ee1767e68e045604037e64ff209c58780",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:389a6e09257f862143481a31",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "威风堂堂地等待着起跑的是这位马娘\n%legend",
      "source_fingerprint": "92197e2a0413a1e5cc8bae339fe0e017dd220cbc8c42d46b44cd707d2ac485b8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:145a9c07b7b045a1e010c32b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "集全场粉丝期待于一身\n%legend",
      "source_fingerprint": "948c8f8df509285428c5c4636719e0de040b566a227ed41cf8b834aa0e9f71a6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c690591ef9ed22821aacdec",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "十二月的阪神赛场\n其名为%h_rank_ta1！\n新女王诞生了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10ae5c6fae1f1a7c27474ea762eb48c7f4f8ee25d34c3dc462f3458ab13f3675",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa44c8e1cf822c129628f4d2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n这位马娘能成为来年\n经典赛的台风之眼吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48f3b575b13aa34b20caec12073b2662b3786453354aad3b8300b460a8a38766",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:201300679cb2c5e5b9ad932d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "称霸梦之大奖赛的是\n%h_rank_ta1！\n夺得了年末最后一场重大赛事的胜利\n登上荣光的宝座！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0431417001b02575cf6ab843aae7ef1d39da02f9c8aafd7dc95e567f5013c851",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a5f844e3182a6159d8cebba",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "自称世代最快的赛马娘们聚集于府中！\nNHK英里杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac5ad025b90495687bbd6f101591e1034092bb58257847dc2c155dac5ff78c0d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7730d655c1a8d7d0bd9dc19d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank1，闪耀着一等星的光辉\n在通往经典赛事的道路上\n迈出了第一步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e40133b7cc8b261a194d9b362bb9a23b2af318b0ded8d1f6453dc2eaee18afc",
